  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Mainline release 1.5.3 includes the preceding integer/addressing fixes and CPU integration changes: 68010 motherboard timing forwarding, 58-byte format-8 frames and system instructions; 68060 FPU arithmetic, 12-byte exceptional state restoration and deferred arithmetic exceptions; architectural 040/060 page tables, permissions, timed descriptor updates and translated fault stacks; MMU interpreter fallback in JIT and public JIT counters. Validated by 4,433 CPU tests and CopperScreen integration/native boot checks. Seven optional CPU conformance checks were unavailable. Advanced CPU profiles remain experimental: physical pipeline/accelerator timing, 68010 fault continuation, complete 040 access-error recovery and native 060-aware OS boot are not qualified. Publication authorized on 2026-10-07.",
